Android museum source derived from the DLSS5 Quality vs Performance Gallery.
Gallery scene construction and animation are generated from the pinned gallery
submodule. Phoenix runtime and headers come from the pinned Phoenix submodule
and its separately downloaded SDK. Both projects retain their own licenses.

Gallery scans, Rocketbox characters and textures are separate downloads. Their
credits and licenses are copied into local APKs by prepare.py. No model weights,
NVIDIA DLLs, museum asset pack or third-party SDK binaries are distributed in
this repository. Project source licensing does not license those separate inputs.
